Package: devos-keyring
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: DevOS <security@devos.local>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: gpgv | gpg
Description: DevOS package archive signing key and APT source
 Installs the DevOS archive signing key and enables the official
 DevOS package repository. Updates are verified with the signed
 InRelease file over HTTPS.
